window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A furious king. A treacherous high court. Can their union overcome these dangers or will their kingdom and love die?</p> <p>Kascia is trapped. The Japcharian summit approaches fast, and King Di’s loathing ensures it will not be easy for newly crowned Princess Kascia. When her husband, Prince Regent Gavril, discovers the level of disrespect they show his new princess, all they’ve worked for crumbles.</p> <p>Touched by his devotion to her, Kascia battles with her desire to trust Gavril’s instinct and her need to prove she is the true princess. Without a new peace treaty with Japcharia, their five-hundred year war may expand to shedding the blood of their northern neighbors.</p> <p>Can she keep her marriage intact and save their two nations, or will she walk into the world summit branded a false princess?</p> <p>Experience the thrill and heartache of the sixth book in The Enthronement series. An enemies-to-lovers fantasy romance turned royal intrigue warfare for not only their nation but their love.</p> <p>Download your copy of The Emboldened to uncover all that truth love can conquer today.</p>"; 
